+### Category Gap Note
+There is still a real gap in public GitHub repositories built specifically for insurance agents, insurance CRMs, comparative raters, AMS replacements, or carrier appetite search. Most open-source coverage today is in adjacent layers such as OCR, RAG, speech, and workflow automation. This list reflects that honestly instead of padding it with unrelated SaaS products.
