+
+> Best AI tools for insurance agents in 2026 are increasingly open source, self-hostable, and GitHub-native. This list focuses on public repositories that help insurance teams handle document intake, OCR, claims packets, call transcription, knowledge retrieval, and workflow automation without depending on proprietary SaaS lock-in.
